flowchart TD
    %% commands: import.preview, import.start, import.continue, import.cancel, export.start, export.cancel, operation.get
    start([Reviewed import or export]) --> kind{Import}
    kind -->|Yes| batch[Bounded parse typed batch and child intent]
    batch --> write[[Fresh batch and COMMIT authority with bound INSERT transaction]]
    write --> known{Observed child batch outcome}
    known -->|Unknown| unknown([Stop job unknown batch no replay])
    known -->|Rolled back failed or cancelled| stopped([Stop partial job preserve earlier commits])
    known -->|Committed| more{More source batches}
    more -->|Yes| batch
    more -->|No| imported([Report confirmed batch outcomes])
    kind -->|No| read{Shown result or approved safe new read}
    read -->|No| denied([Reject unapproved reexecution])
    read -->|Yes| partial[Stream into partial file]
    partial --> complete{Complete source terminal and flush sync succeeded}
    complete -->|No| unfinished([Keep partial status])
    complete -->|Yes| rename[[Atomic finalize]]
    rename --> finalized{Atomic finalize confirmed}
    finalized -->|No| unfinished
    finalized -->|Yes| exported([Export complete with consistency scope])
